  "sourceTitle": "Pakistani Curry Powder",
  "sourceText": "Pakistani Curry Powder\nBy: miansari66\nPublished: Thursday, November 25, 2010 - 10:46pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 teaspoons Cooking salt\n3 teaspoons Chilli whole\n5 teaspoons Coriander whole\n1 teaspoon Cumin whole\n1/2 teaspoon Caraway whole\n1 teaspoon Haldi\n1 teaspoon Garam Masala\n1 teaspoon Sonth\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Clean all ingredients 2 Mix all the ingredient and grind and sieve. 3 Store in an air tight container.\n\nAbout\n\n\nUsed 2-3 teaspoon of this curry powder for any curry to be served for 5 person",
